 "construction": "Scrap, from the Pass 1 gun (kept: one colour family - red oxide, brown and rust; a drum pedestal with braces; an open frame receiver; a pipe barrel). New, as controlled asymmetry and visible repair: three different leg braces; a doubler plate welded over a crack; the left bracket is a tall drilled plate, the right one a short angle with a patch; a hand wheel that turns when aiming; an armour shield on ONE side only; a half heat-shield with punched holes; the barrel is two pipes of different bore joined by a clamped sleeve and ends in a welded cage",
